# E-Commerce API with AI

## Working in http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

We successfully set up the foundational architecture and connected our database. Here is the documentation of our progress and the roadmap for the endpoints we need to build next.

### Environment Setup & Execution

To activate the virtual environment and fire up the development server, run the following commands in your terminal:


# 1. Activate the virtual environment
source venv/bin/activate

# 2. Run the FastAPI server with auto-reload
uvicorn main:app --reload


ENDPOINTS:  
Autentification:
POST /auth/register 
POST /auth/login 

products:
GET /products 
GET /products/{id} 
POST /products 

cart:
GET /cart 
POST /cart/add 
DELETE /cart/remove/{item_id}

Órders and payments:
POST /orders/checkout 
POST /orders/webhook-stripe 